    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"DE\">PACKAGE\r\nANNOUNCEMENT:<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"DE\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"DE\">Dear R/qtlcommunity,<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"DE\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">I\r\nwould like to announce the release of the „ABHgenotypeR” package for R.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">The<span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\"> </span></span><code style=\"border-top-left-radius:3px;border-top-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-left-radius:3px\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Consolas;color:#333333;background:#f7f7f7\">ABHgenotypeR</span></code><span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\"> </span></span>package\r\nprovides simple imputation, error-correction and plotting capacities for\r\ngenotype data. The functions in this package were initially developed for the\r\nGBS/QTL analysis pipeline described in:<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><em><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">Furuta T.,\r\nReuscher S. et. al., 2016 Adapting genotyping by sequencing for rice F2\r\npopulations.<u></u><u></u></span></em></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><em><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">BMC Genomics </span></em><em><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;font-style:normal\">(<b>in revision</b>)</span></em><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">The<span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\"> </span></span><code style=\"border-top-left-radius:3px;border-top-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-left-radius:3px\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Consolas;color:#333333;background:#f7f7f7\">ABHgenotypeR</span></code><span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\"> </span></span>package is\r\nsupposed to serve as an intermediate, but independent analysis tool between the\r\nTASSEL GBS pipeline and the<span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\"> </span></span><code style=\"border-top-left-radius:3px;border-top-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-left-radius:3px\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Consolas;color:#333333;background:#f7f7f7\">qtl</span></code><span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\"> </span></span>package. As\r\nsuch it works directly on the output of the TASSEL GenosToABH plugin which is\r\nalso one of the inputs needed for <span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\"> </span></span><code style=\"border-top-left-radius:3px;border-top-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-left-radius:3px\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Consolas;color:#333333;background:#f7f7f7\">qtl</span></code><span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\"> .<u></u><u></u></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\"> </span></span><code style=\"border-top-left-radius:3px;border-top-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-left-radius:3px\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Consolas;color:#333333;background:#f7f7f7\">ABHgenotypeR</span></code><span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\"> </span></span>provides\r\nfunctionalities not found in either TASSEL or<span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\"> </span></span><code style=\"border-top-left-radius:3px;border-top-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-left-radius:3px\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Consolas;color:#333333;background:#f7f7f7\">qtl</span></code><span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\"> </span></span>in addition\r\nto visualization of genotypes as graphical genotypes. Advanced R users may\r\nutilize the full power of<span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\"> </span></span><code style=\"border-top-left-radius:3px;border-top-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-left-radius:3px\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Consolas;color:#333333;background:#f7f7f7\">ggplot2</span></code><span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\"> </span></span>to create\r\nfigures.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">To install from CRAN:<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;background:rgb(247,247,247)\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Consolas;color:#333333\">install.package(</span><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Consolas;color:#183691\">&quot;ABHgenotypeR&quot;</span><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Consolas;color:#333333\">)<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:rgb(247,247,247)\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Consolas;color:#333333\">library(ABHgenotypeR)<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">or from github:<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;background:rgb(247,247,247)\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Consolas;color:#969896\">#needs &quot;devtools&quot;</span><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Consolas;color:#333333\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;background:rgb(247,247,247)\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Consolas;color:#333333\">install.packages(</span><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Consolas;color:#183691\">&quot;devtools&quot;</span><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Consolas;color:#333333\">)<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;background:rgb(247,247,247)\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Consolas;color:#333333\">library(devtools)<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;background:rgb(247,247,247)\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Consolas;color:#333333\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:rgb(247,247,247)\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Consolas;color:#333333\">install_github(</span><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Consolas;color:#183691\">&quot;StefanReuscher/ABHgenotypeR&quot;</span><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Consolas;color:#333333\">, </span><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Consolas;color:#ed6a43\">build_vignettes</span><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Consolas;color:#333333\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Consolas;color:#a71d5d\">=</span><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Consolas;color:#333333\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Consolas;color:#0086b3\">TRUE</span><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Consolas;color:#333333\">)<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">for more information and an example workflow run:<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:rgb(247,247,247)\"><span lang=\"DE\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Consolas;color:#333333\">vignette(</span><span lang=\"DE\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Consolas;color:#183691\">&quot;ABHgenotypeR-vignette&quot;</span><span lang=\"DE\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Consolas;color:#333333\">, </span><span lang=\"DE\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Consolas;color:#ed6a43\">package</span><span lang=\"DE\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Consolas;color:#333333\"> </span><span lang=\"DE\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Consolas;color:#a71d5d\">=</span><span lang=\"DE\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Consolas;color:#333333\"> </span><span lang=\"DE\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Consolas;color:#183691\">&quot;ABHgenotypeR&quot;</span><span lang=\"DE\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Consolas;color:#333333\">)<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"DE\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">If you find it useful or want to report a bug send an email\r\nto <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">reus...@agr.nagoya-u.ac.jp</a>,\r\nor contact me via github or this group.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Disclaimer: I am not affiliated with either the TASSEL or\r\nthe<span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\"> </span></span><code style=\"border-top-left-radius:3px;border-top-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-left-radius:3px\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Consolas;color:#333333;background:#f7f7f7\">qtl</span></code><span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\"> </span></span>developers.\r\nThe <code><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Consolas;color:#333333;background:#f7f7f7\">ABHgenotypeR</span></code><span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\"> </span></span>package was\r\ndeveloped first and foremost to aid us in genotyping our rice populations. We hope\r\nhowever that it will be useful to other people as well. Since we did not test\r\nthis package very extensively with data from species other than rice or from a\r\nSNP caller other than TASSEL: Use at your own risk.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Also sorry for using this board for slightly off-topic\r\nthings.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Greetings,<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Stefan<u></u><u></u></p></div>"
    ]
   ]
  }
 ]
}
